{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《中年好聲音4越唱越強演唱會》的首場演出昨晚（14日）於伊利沙伯體育館（伊館）順利舉行並圓滿落幕！備受矚目的十強歌手陣容，包括尹景順、許雲妮、鄭家聲、蔡宓婕、吳亦偉、尤淑情、許美琪、周志康、陳旭培以及鄭仲豪，齊齊在台上施展渾身解數，為入場支持的觀眾獻上一場視覺與聽覺雙重享受的豐富盛宴。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"5de7e95c-0901-4bf0-8dc9-ca90ae324ff3.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026VEgGZfs18S1792059144.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"fbeaef99-34e1-41a7-a386-52a67ce9f964.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026G4FzC6URIa1792059143.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"2cf25eaa-e034-4f6f-8d97-a07d32aea634.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026CPUbTdMS3j1792059142.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>來到感性的分享環節，10位歌手不約而同地向這個比賽舞台表達謝意，感激比賽讓他們有機會踏上大舞台，親身唱歌給大家聽。眾人亦非常感恩在過去一年的歷程中，彼此結下深厚的友誼，一直互相鼓勵與扶持。他們期望在未來的任何演出中，都能夠繼續聽到觀眾熱烈的掌聲。</p><p></p><p>演唱會去到尾聲，十強歌手齊聲獻唱周華健的經典金曲《朋友》，以動人歌聲總結彼此的友誼，為全晚演出畫上最完美的句號。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T10:39:39.898459+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:46.641820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:37:38.591754+00:00","content_hash":"ac153287a73a526dd4bbf6addf8e9ad4539e94f03a9b9a3d2fcfab8727dead60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}